          "chunk_id": "warfarin::drug_interactions::01",
          "quote": "Inhibitors of CYP2C9, 1A2, and/or 3A4 have the potential to increase the effect (increase INR) of warfarin by increasing the exposure of warfarin."
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "warfarin::drug_interactions::00",
          "quote": "More frequent INR monitoring should be performed when starting or stopping other drugs, including botanicals, or when changing dosages of other drugs, including drugs intended for short-term use"
        }
      ]
    }
